    <text><paragraph>Historical biography with true dates. These events are not part of the synthetic care timeline.</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Historical date</th><th>History</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1950</td><td>Benign tumor removed from the left breast</td><td>D (CLM-0004)</td></tr><tr><td>Early 1960</td><td>Two lumps found in the left breast while writing a book</td><td>D (CLM-0006)</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

