<component><section><templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.17" extension="2015-08-01"/><code code="29762-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Social history Narrative"/><title>Social History</title><text><list><item>Occupation: marine biologist and writer, formerly a government science editor; finishing a book on the effects of chemical pesticides, with a deadline this year; works at home most days [S]</item><item>Never smoker; a glass of sherry a few times a month; walks most days and spends summers on the coast studying tide pools [S]</item><item>Lives in her own house; never married; independent [S]</item><item>Supports: a close friend and her editor; she shares health news with very few people [S]</item><item>Reproductive history: no pregnancies; menopause at 51; never used menopausal hormone therapy [S]</item></list></text></section></component>

