    <text><list><item>Diagnostic mammography and ultrasound of the left breast and axilla this week, then image-guided core biopsy with ER, PR, HER2, and Ki-67 testing. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Breast Cancer, Version 5.2025 (2025); CMID: Clinical Monitoring Intelligence Database, breast cancer monograph (2026) [S]</item><item>Breast surgical oncology consultation once the biopsy result is available, to discuss surgical options and axillary staging with her. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Breast Cancer, Version 5.2025 (2025) [S]</item><item>Disclosure and shared decision-making: ask what she wants to know, give each result in person and in plain words with a written copy, check understanding by teach-back, and make every decision with her; share her health information only with the people she names. Guideline: Code of Medical Ethics Opinion 2.1.3: Withholding Information from Patients (2016); Patient-Clinician Communication: American Society of Clinical Oncology Consensus Guideline. J Clin Oncol 2017;35(31):3618-3632 (2017) [S]</item><item>Test of cure for Helicobacter pylori by urea breath test at least four weeks after antibiotics and two weeks after stopping omeprazole. Guideline: ACG Clinical Guideline: Treatment of Helicobacter pylori Infection. Am J Gastroenterol 2024;119(9):1730-1753 (2024) [S]</item><item>Knee osteoarthritis: walking and strengthening exercise, acetaminophen as needed, no nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs after her ulcer. Guideline: 2019 American College of Rheumatology/Arthritis Foundation Guideline for the Management of Osteoarthritis of the Hand, Hip, and Knee (2019) [S]</item><item ID="referral-order">Referral to surgical oncology (breast), Henrietta Solís-Abernathy, MD, ordered 2026-03-09 [S]</item></list></text>

